    "text": "13 hours ago OSCEOLA COUNTY, Fla. — As the United States prepares to mark its 250th birthday, Osceola County is officially joining the nationwide celebration by launching a year-long tribute to the nation’s semiquincentennial, known as America 250. The Osceola Board of County Commissioners has announced a series of commemorative efforts... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
